        "alt": "Fry the chicken and tomatoes",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "id": "step-4",
      "heading": "Add the spices",
      "blocks": [
        "Add the curry powder, ground paprika and ginger and garlic paste. Cook 1 minute until fragrant."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
          "label": "Fry the spices",
          "seconds": [
            60
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image": {
        "id": "quick-chicken-tikka-masala-3-sketch",
        "path": "media/quick-chicken-tikka-masala-3-sketch.webp",
        "alt": "Add the spices",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "id": "step-5",
      "heading": "Simmer the curry",
      "blocks": [
        "Add {{sauce-water}} boiled water and the stock mix. Bring to the boil over high heat. Lower to medium-high, cover and cook for 6 minutes more or until the chicken is cooked through with no pink meat."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
          "label": "Simmer the curry",
          "seconds": [
            360
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image": {
        "id": "quick-chicken-tikka-masala-4-sketch",
        "path": "media/quick-chicken-tikka-masala-4-sketch.webp",
        "alt": "Simmer the curry",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "id": "step-6",
      "heading": "Heat the rice",
      "blocks": [
        "Squeeze the rice pouch to separate the grains. Tear the top corner open a little and microwave for 2 minutes or until piping hot."
      ],
      "notes": [
        "If heating two pouches together, increase the microwave time accordingly."
      ],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
          "label": "Heat the rice",
          "seconds": [
            120
          ]
        }
      ],
